+{"name":"Vendor Mantine runtime once v3","on":{"push":{"branches":["main"],"paths":[".github/workflows/vendor-mantine-runtime-v3.yml"]}},"permissions":{"contents":"write"},"concurrency":{"group":"vendor-mantine-runtime-once-v3","cancel-in-progress":false},"jobs":{"vendor":{"if":"github.actor != 'github-actions[bot]' && github.event.head_commit.message == 'Add executable Mantine vendor builder'","runs-on":"ubuntu-24.04","steps":[{"uses":"actions/checkout@v4","with":{"fetch-depth":2}},{"name":"Build, validate, and commit vendored runtime","shell":"bash","run":"set -euo pipefail\nwork=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\ncd \"$work\"\nnpm init -y >/dev/null\nnpm install --no-audit --no-fund --save-exact react@19.2.8 react-dom@19.2.8 @mantine/core@9.5.2 @mantine/hooks@9.5.2 esbuild@0.25.9\ncat > entry.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as React from 'react';\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client';\nimport * as MantineCore from '@mantine/core';\nimport * as MantineHooks from '@mantine/hooks';\nwindow.FastFigureUiRuntime = Object.freeze({ React, createRoot, MantineCore, MantineHooks });\nEOF\n./node_modules/.bin/esbuild entry.js --bundle --format=iife --platform=browser --target=es2022 --minify --legal-comments=inline --banner:js='/*! Fast Figure vendored UI runtime: React 19.2.8, ReactDOM 19.2.8, Mantine 9.5.2; MIT licenses reproduced in LICENSE and the built-in README. */' --outfile=runtime.js\ncd \"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE\"\ncp \"$work/runtime.js\" .vendor-runtime.js\ncp \"$work/node_modules/@mantine/core/styles.css\" .vendor-mantine.css\ncp \"$work/node_modules/react/LICENSE\" .vendor-react-license\ncp \"$work/node_modules/@mantine/core/LICENSE\" .vendor-mantine-license\npython - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\nhtml=Path(\"Fast-figure.html\")\ntext=html.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nruntime=Path(\".vendor-runtime.js\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\ncss=\"\\n\".join(line.rstrip() for line in Path(\".vendor-mantine.css\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").splitlines())+\"\\n\"\nreact_license=Path(\".vendor-react-license\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").strip()\nmantine_license=Path(\".vendor-mantine-license\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").strip()\nif 'id=\"ff-mantine-runtime\"' in text: raise SystemExit(\"runtime already exists\")\nplotly='    <script>\\n      Plotly.setPlotConfig({ topojsonURL: \"\" });\\n    </script>\\n'\nif text.count(plotly)!=1: raise SystemExit(\"plotly insertion point changed\")\nvendor=f'''{plotly}    <!-- Vendored React/Mantine runtime; no runtime network dependency. -->\n    <script id=\"ff-mantine-runtime\">\n{runtime}\n    </script>\n    <style id=\"ff-mantine-core-styles\">\n{css}    </style>\n'''\ntext=text.replace(plotly,vendor,1)\nbody='  <body>\\n'\nbootstrap='''  <body>\n    <div id=\"ff-react-bootstrap-root\" hidden></div>\n    <script id=\"ff-mantine-bootstrap\">\n      (() => {\n        const runtime = window.FastFigureUiRuntime;\n        if (!runtime) throw new Error(\"Fast Figure UI runtime failed to load\");\n        const root = runtime.createRoot(document.getElementById(\"ff-react-bootstrap-root\"));\n        root.render(runtime.React.createElement(runtime.MantineCore.MantineProvider, { defaultColorScheme: \"light\" }, runtime.React.createElement(runtime.React.Fragment, null)));\n        window.fastFigureUiRoot = root;\n      })();\n    </script>\n'''\nif text.count(body)!=1: raise SystemExit(\"body insertion point changed\")\ntext=text.replace(body,bootstrap,1)\nif text.count('const APP_BUILD = \"1.1.29-alpha\";')!=1: raise SystemExit(\"APP_BUILD baseline changed\")\ntext=text.replace('const APP_BUILD = \"1.1.29-alpha\";','const APP_BUILD = \"1.1.30-alpha\";',1)\nif text.count('<p><code>1.1.29-alpha</code></p>')!=1: raise SystemExit(\"README version baseline changed\")\ntext=text.replace('<p><code>1.1.29-alpha</code></p>','<p><code>1.1.30-alpha</code></p>',1)\nmarker='          <p><strong>Iconoir 7.11.1</strong></p>\\n'\nif text.count(marker)!=1: raise SystemExit(\"README third-party insertion point changed\")\nthird=f'''          <p><strong>React / ReactDOM 19.2.8</strong></p>\n          <p>Fast figure bundles React and ReactDOM directly in this HTML file as part of the UI runtime. No external React runtime is required.</p>\n          <ul><li>Source repository: <a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/react\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com/facebook/react</a></li><li>Package version used: <code>19.2.8</code></li><li>License: MIT</li></ul>\n          <p><strong>React license</strong></p><pre>{react_license}</pre>\n          <p><strong>Mantine 9.5.2</strong></p>\n          <p>Fast figure bundles <code>@mantine/core</code> and <code>@mantine/hooks</code> directly in this HTML file.</p>\n          <ul><li>Source repository: <a href=\"https://github.com/mantinedev/mantine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com/mantinedev/mantine</a></li><li>Package version used: <code>9.5.2</code></li><li>License: MIT</li></ul>\n          <p><strong>Mantine license</strong></p><pre>{mantine_license}</pre>\n'''\ntext=text.replace(marker,third+marker,1)\nhtml.write_text(text,encoding=\"utf-8\")\nlic=Path(\"LICENSE\")\nlt=lic.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nlt+=f'''\\n\\nReact / ReactDOM\n----------------\n\nComponent version: 19.2.8\nSource repository: https://github.com/facebook/react\n\nFast Figure bundles React and ReactDOM directly in the portable HTML file.\n\n{react_license}\n\n\nMantine\n-------\n\nComponent version: 9.5.2\nSource repository: https://github.com/mantinedev/mantine\n\nFast Figure bundles @mantine/core and @mantine/hooks directly in the portable HTML file.\n\n{mantine_license}\n'''\nlic.write_text(lt,encoding=\"utf-8\")\ncheck=html.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nblock=re.search(r'<script id=\"ff-mantine-runtime\">\\n(.*?)\\n    </script>',check,re.S)\nif not block or '<script src=' in block.group(1) or 'import(\"http' in block.group(1) or \"import('http\" in block.group(1): raise SystemExit(\"runtime not self-contained\")\nPath(\"/tmp/fast-figure-main.js\").write_text(check.rsplit(\"<script>\",1)[1].split(\"</script>\",1)[0],encoding=\"utf-8\")\nPY\nrm -f .vendor-runtime.js .vendor-mantine.css .vendor-react-license .vendor-mantine-license\nnode --check /tmp/fast-figure-main.js\ngit diff --check\nmkdir -p agent_space/patches\ngit diff -- Fast-figure.html LICENSE > agent_space/patches/20260831-013.patch\ncat > agent_space/patches/20260831-013.md <<'EOF'\n# 20260831-013\n\n## 목적\nReact/Mantine production runtime을 `Fast-figure.html` 내부에 vendoring하고 기존 UI를 변경하지 않은 상태에서 하나의 `MantineProvider` bootstrap 경계를 만든다.\n\n## 변경 내용\n- React/ReactDOM 19.2.8과 `@mantine/core`/`@mantine/hooks` 9.5.2를 단일 HTML 안에 번들했다.\n- Mantine core CSS와 비가시 bootstrap root를 추가했다.\n- 애플리케이션 버전을 1.1.30-alpha로 올렸다.\n- built-in README와 top-level LICENSE에 React/Mantine MIT 고지를 추가했다.\n- 기존 toolbar/sidebar/overlay DOM은 변경하지 않았다.\n\n## 이 방향을 선택한 이유\nDependency/bootstrap 문제와 실제 UI migration 문제를 분리하여 회귀 원인을 좁히기 위해서다.\n\n## 고려했지만 선택하지 않은 방향\n- CDN runtime은 portable/offline 요구와 충돌하므로 사용하지 않았다.\n- toolbar/modal을 동시에 교체하지 않았다.\n- `@mantine/modals`는 사용하지 않는다. overlay 상태는 EFSM이 소유한다.\n\n## 검증\n- inline IIFE runtime/bootstrap\n- 외부 module/script runtime 의존성 부재\n- 버전 일치와 LICENSE 고지\n- main JavaScript `node --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## 패치에 포함되지 않은 변경사항\n이 설명 파일과 patch 기록 파일 자체는 재귀적으로 diff에 포함하지 않는다.\nEOF\ngit add Fast-figure.html LICENSE agent_space/patches/20260831-013.patch agent_space/patches/20260831-013.md\ngit config user.name 'github-actions[bot]'\ngit config user.email '41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com'\ngit commit -m 'Vendor React and Mantine runtime'\ngit push origin main\n"}]}}}
